"evidence":[{"id":"60bcca451bb2bac3cfc2c806b1611c57274f31793b032592f770c7b5b76852e0","quote":"| | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | Q2 2025 | Q3 2025 | Q4 2025 | Q1 2026 | Q2 2026 Total Bookings (in millions) | $ | 222.9 | $ | 260.1 | $ | 287.1 | $ | 291.7 | $ | 295.9 Total CLEAR Members (in thousands) | 33,472 | 35,751 | 37,998 | 40,986 | 43,501 Active CLEAR+ Members (in thousands) | 7,227 | 7,399 | 7,616 | 8,167 | 8,329","context":"Key Performance Indicators","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":31,"table":" |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n | Q2 2025 | Q3 2025 | Q4 2025 | Q1 2026 | Q2 2026\nTotal Bookings (in millions) | $ | 222.9 | $ | 260.1 | $ | 287.1 | $ | 291.7 | $ | 295.9\nTotal CLEAR Members (in thousands) | 33,472 | 35,751 | 37,998 | 40,986 | 43,501\nActive CLEAR+ Members (in thousands) | 7,227 | 7,399 | 7,616 | 8,167 | 8,329","attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"c9fbb5dce56736fc31747481ef2a9a7fece6c3793fa2e85ef3b3018c0f111f45","quote":"To evaluate performance of the business, we utilize a variety of other non-GAAP financial reporting and performance measures. These key measures include Total Bookings, Total CLEAR Members, and Active CLEAR+ Members.","context":"Definitions of Key Performance Indicators","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":33,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"f78dd3786b570cc222175ea41c4952a57354347ffce150314d07e2333b76830e","quote":"Total Bookings represent our total revenue plus the change in deferred revenue during the period. Total Bookings in any particular period reflect sales to new and renewing CLEAR+ subscribers plus any accrued billings to partners. Management believes that Total Bookings is an important measure of the current health and growth of the business and views it as a leading indicator.","context":"Total Bookings","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":35,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"7968a6ffaca4173ebc6e812184dd06ee4d09b3d2191c84884e0a2c19271740cf","quote":"We define Total CLEAR Members as the cumulative number of Members that have registered for the CLEAR platform since inception as of the end of the period. This includes Members who have enrolled through CLEAR+, trials, single-use product purchases, other non-paid uses of the CLEAR platform, and associated family accounts. Total CLEAR Members exclude members who are solely marketing opt-ins and purged accounts, and are adjusted to remove identified duplicate non-paid accounts. Management views this metric as an important tool to analyze the efficacy of our growth and marketing initiatives as new Members are potentially a current and leading indicator of revenues.","context":"Total CLEAR Members","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":37,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"34207956f9c246570c5ae05600a99b7d563c88ced43b00cff3aaed8b7157fd04","quote":"We define Active CLEAR+ Members as the number of members with an active CLEAR+ subscription as of the end of the period. This includes CLEAR+ members who have an activated payment method, plus associated family accounts and is inclusive of Members who are in a trial or in a billing grace period. Management views this as an important tool to measure the growth of its CLEAR+ product.","context":"Active CLEAR+ Members","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":39,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"0f550cfcca05acce6ace6b2cc71f6468164bf371cdfc4a9a0b54c6067810972d","quote":"Prior period Active CLEAR+ Members have been recast to reflect the removal of certain lapsed accounts identified in connection with a billing system transformation project undertaken during 2025. This recast had no impact on our consolidated financial statements or non-GAAP financial measures. There has been no other change in the calculation of Active CLEAR+ Members.","context":"We define Active CLEAR+ Members as the number of members with an active CLEAR+ subscription as of the end of the period. This includes CLEAR+ members who have an activated payment method, plus associated family accounts and is inclusive of Members who are in a trial or in a billing grace period. Management views this as an important tool to measure the growth of its CLEAR+ product.","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":40,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"b67a0214949984aa58289fcdb3d552eebaa9f1c7be001d98ac138ff06d1b1767","quote":"(dollars in thousands, except share and per share data)","context":"(UNAUDITED)","section":"Key Performance Indicators","block":45,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001856314-26-000039","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-08-05","cik":"0001856314","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000185631426000039/clearq22026pressreleaseear.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74.bin","sha256":"c8c446728660a0f80e89162de516ef31b0fbf1d8df1c94e9456b32025152ae74"}},{"id":"a62271d730e382ee329b661f11215819c4ace7b394deb22f1cff4b75c766cf15","quote":"| | | | | | | | | | | | June 30,2026 | | December 31,2025 A